                    "node": {
                      "text": "A new album and font go really nice together 🩷\n\n@oliviarodrigo’s (Olivia Rodrigo) new album “you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love” is raw, vulnerable and completely hers. \n\n“Creating something that feels true to me. I feel like it’s why I love what I do so much. When you stumble upon something that really plays on one of your heartstrings, it’s such a great feeling.”\n\nAnd now she’s designed an Instagram font that’s curly, cursive and the kind of handwriting you’d use to write someone a love letter: “It’s not trying too hard, but it’s also kind of cutesy. And I’d like to think that I’m like that.” Try it now in Stories."
                    }
